nly the genes next to the RpoS holoenzyme-binding sites are shown] and the gene orientation (shown by arrows in the column of transcription direction). A total of 73 RpoS holoenzyme-binding sites are located inside open reading frames as indicated by the gene symbols shown in RpoS column.</p></fn><fn id="t001fn002"><p>*The genes listed in RegulonDB as the regulated targets of RpoS.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="pone.0179181.t002" orientation="portrait" position="float"><object-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pone.0179181.t002</object-id><label>Table 2</label><caption><title>Distribution of the binding sites of each RNAP holoenzyme.</title></caption><alternatives><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" id="pone.0179181.t002g" position="float" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="pone.0179181.t002.jpg"><?image-name pone.0179181.t002.jpg?><?image-size 94639?><?image-md5 1553755fd26a555c6b412f5b8ace1756?><?image-image-server-status LOAD_COMPLETED?><?image-original-height 930?><?image-original-width 2256?><?image-scaled-height 310?><?image-scaled-width 752?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/b9a9/5493296/1553755fd26a/pone.0179181.t002.jpg?><?thumb-name pone.0179181.t002.gif?><?thumb-size 13865?><?thumb-md5 74c547da4ce04ea96762f09bb3256db1?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 194?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/b9a9/5493296/74c547da4ce0/pone.0179181.t002.gif?></graphic><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/><col align="left" valign="middle" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Sigma</th><th align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Total no. holoenzyme binding sites</th><th align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1">Within Spacers</th><th align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Inside Genes</th><th align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1">Constitutive promoters</th></tr><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Type-A</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Type-B</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Type-C</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Type-A spacer</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Type-B spacer</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>RpoD</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>1320</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>177</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>317</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>49</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>777 (60%)</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>177~354</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>317</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>494~671</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><bold>543 (40%)</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>RpoS</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>218</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>50</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>79</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>16</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>73 (33%)</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>50~100</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>79</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>129~179</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><bold>125 (67%)</bold></td></tr><tr>